# SnapFit mobile — environment variables
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (never commit the real file) and fill in real values.
# IMPORTANT: only EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables are inlined into the client bundle.
# Anything WITHOUT that prefix stays on the server and must never be renamed
# to EXPO_PUBLIC_* — that would embed the secret in the app bundle.

# GEMINI_API_KEY — server-only secret used by the AI coach proxy API route
# (src/app/api/coach+api.ts). Read as process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY at request time
# and sent to Google as the `x-goog-api-key` header. The client only ever calls
# POST /api/coach and receives { text }; it never sees this value.
# Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY="YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY"

# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL — origin of this app's API server, used by
# src/services/coach.ts to reach /api/coach from a physical device on your LAN.
# Leave unset in development: the dev-server hostUri is detected automatically.
# Safe to expose (it is a URL, not a secret) — but never put GEMINI_API_KEY here.
# Example: EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL="http://192.168.1.20:8081"
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL="http://localhost:8081"
